<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n85195" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολυ-πλᾰνής</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ές</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πλανάομαι</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>roaming far</i> or <i>long,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν ἁλὶ πολυπλανής</span> (sc. Menelaus)
				<i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Hel.</u>
				203
			</span></i> (lyr.); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἶδος κτημάτων
			π.,</span> opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπλανές,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Plt.</u>
				288a
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. κισσός</span> the
			<i>straying</i> ivy, <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				6.154
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Leon.
			</span></i> or <i><span class="en">
				Gaet.
			</span></i>); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. πορεία</span>”
				<i>devious,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Crass.</u>
					29
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. ἐν γράμμασι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					2.422d
				</span></i>
			. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-νῶς</span>”
				<i>wandering in all directions,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Oss.</u>
					12
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>much-erring</i> (or 
				Act.
			, <i>leading much astray</i>), 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἐλπὶς καὶ Τύχη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					9.134
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔπεα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Musae.
					175
				</span></i>
			. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[-πλᾱνης</span> metri gr. in <i><span class="en">
				Opp.
				<u>C.</u>
				4.358
			</span></i>.]</div>
